WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:39.679 --> 00:01:44.139
Look! Look, Tenchi!
The city of Shibuya looks so small!

00:01:48.288 --> 00:01:49.983
Ryoko?

00:01:53.894 --> 00:01:55.896
What's wrong, Tenchi?

00:01:55.896 --> 00:01:58.194
Oh, it's nothing.

00:02:06.873 --> 00:02:12.479
With Mihoshi and Kiyone gone,
it's kinda lonely around here, huh?

00:02:12.479 --> 00:02:15.182
I wonder if Ryoko's ever gonna come back?

00:02:15.182 --> 00:02:18.351
Lonely? Hardly!

00:02:18.351 --> 00:02:22.185
I'm glad to be rid of those barbarians.

00:02:24.891 --> 00:02:25.880
But still...

00:02:48.181 --> 00:02:49.808
Ryoko!

00:02:54.654 --> 00:02:56.823
Washu!

00:02:56.823 --> 00:02:58.848
Kiyone! Mihoshi!

00:03:00.427 --> 00:03:02.062
Sasami!

00:03:02.062 --> 00:03:03.859
Ryo-Ohki!

00:03:33.693 --> 00:03:35.795
It was a dream?

00:03:35.795 --> 00:03:37.695
What a bad omen...

00:03:43.503 --> 00:03:46.907
Why am I so worked up?

00:03:46.907 --> 00:03:50.240
It's as if something horrible will happen.

00:03:50.911 --> 00:03:52.845
What a quiet evening.

00:03:55.081 --> 00:03:58.184
We meet again, Princess.

00:03:58.184 --> 00:04:00.253
Y-You're...

00:04:00.253 --> 00:04:06.021
It's always calm before
a storm. Be sure to take care.

00:04:09.796 --> 00:04:11.730
Then, that dream was a...

00:04:12.632 --> 00:04:18.004
Princess, I must take my leave of
you now. We'll meet again someday.

00:04:18.004 --> 00:04:20.607
Wait! Who are you?

00:04:20.607 --> 00:04:23.043
Why have you told me this?

00:04:23.043 --> 00:04:26.846
I'm sorry, but I can't
explain it to you in detail.

00:04:26.846 --> 00:04:31.718
But I've been ordered here by someone.

00:04:31.718 --> 00:04:33.019
"Someone"?

00:04:33.019 --> 00:04:38.480
That's right. Someone
who is worried about you.

00:04:41.494 --> 00:04:43.121
Wait!

00:04:44.631 --> 00:04:46.690
That person...

00:04:48.501 --> 00:04:49.934
Who in the world?

00:04:52.372 --> 00:04:53.506
Princess.

00:04:53.506 --> 00:04:55.909
Is something wrong, Princess?

00:04:55.909 --> 00:04:58.612
Can't you sleep?

00:04:58.612 --> 00:05:01.581
Azaka, Kamidake... Just now, there was...

00:05:01.581 --> 00:05:03.516
- Ma'am?
- Ma'am?

00:05:03.516 --> 00:05:07.316
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:05:14.094 --> 00:05:16.896
How did you do on the test, Tenchi?

00:05:16.896 --> 00:05:18.198
Okay, I guess.

00:05:18.198 --> 00:05:21.401
Wow, that's amazing! I totally bombed it!

00:05:21.401 --> 00:05:24.938
No way! You studied really hard, right?

00:05:24.938 --> 00:05:26.640
Yeah, but still...

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:27.874
Tenchi.

00:05:27.874 --> 00:05:31.378
How well did you do in Okayama?

00:05:31.378 --> 00:05:33.346
Okayama?

00:05:36.783 --> 00:05:38.683
What is it?

00:05:43.189 --> 00:05:45.725
What are you looking so
depressed about, Masaki?!

00:05:45.725 --> 00:05:49.629
Yeah, you've got a babe
like this for a girlfriend.

00:05:49.629 --> 00:05:52.265
L-I'm not really depressed or anything.

00:05:52.265 --> 00:05:57.567
Liar! You look like you left a
girlfriend behind in the boonies.

00:05:58.104 --> 00:05:59.606
G-Get real!

00:05:59.606 --> 00:06:03.977
'Fess up, or I'll hit you with a German!

00:06:03.977 --> 00:06:06.571
L-It's nothing! Honest!

00:06:07.614 --> 00:06:09.916
You three are really close.

00:06:09.916 --> 00:06:12.077
I'm a little jealous.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:14.754
Yeah!

00:06:14.754 --> 00:06:17.223
The Three Stooges! That's us!

00:06:17.223 --> 00:06:19.125
When did this happen?

00:06:19.125 --> 00:06:22.424
Yes! Something isn't right!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:28.401
Sorry. We're out of our usual <i>miso</i> soup,
so I tried cutting it with another kind.

00:06:28.401 --> 00:06:30.103
It didn't work, huh?

00:06:30.103 --> 00:06:32.706
That's not what I meant.

00:06:32.706 --> 00:06:34.974
The boiled spinach, then?

00:06:34.974 --> 00:06:39.446
The grocer I usually go to was closed, so
I went to the supermarket in the next town.

00:06:39.446 --> 00:06:42.244
It's because it's a little wilted, isn't it?

00:06:43.216 --> 00:06:44.551
That's not it.

00:06:44.551 --> 00:06:48.588
Is it the broiled <i>taro,</i> then?

00:06:48.588 --> 00:06:54.194
When I was reading a comic,
it got a little bit burned.

00:06:54.194 --> 00:06:56.696
That's not it, I'm telling you!

00:06:56.696 --> 00:07:03.403
What I'm talking about is now!
The state of affairs in this house!

00:07:03.403 --> 00:07:06.039
The Princess seems angry today.

00:07:06.039 --> 00:07:08.906
A calcium deficiency, perhaps...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.878
"The state of affairs in this house"?

00:07:11.878 --> 00:07:13.546
That's right!

00:07:13.546 --> 00:07:15.482
Ryoko has gone missing,

00:07:15.482 --> 00:07:20.620
and Mihoshi and Kiyone
have transferred to Station 62.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:24.954
And to top it all off, Washu
has holed herself up in her lab.

00:07:26.559 --> 00:07:33.967
At a time like this, who cares
about spinach or boiled <i>taro!</i>

00:07:33.967 --> 00:07:37.837
We were so proud of our tight
bond centering around Lord Tenchi,

00:07:37.837 --> 00:07:39.506
but now we've been scattered!

00:07:39.506 --> 00:07:43.610
If we don't do something, I have a
feeling that something bad will happen.

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.012
The blood of the First Princess
of Jurai's royal house

00:07:46.012 --> 00:07:49.311
is trying to tell me something!

00:07:51.718 --> 00:07:53.913
Ayeka sure is acting funny...

00:08:04.063 --> 00:08:07.534
That said, what should we do?

00:08:07.534 --> 00:08:10.003
We can't reach Ryoko,

00:08:10.003 --> 00:08:16.101
and Station 62, where Mihoshi
and Kiyone are, is far away on Pluto.

00:08:19.512 --> 00:08:21.946
Washu! Washu!

00:08:23.016 --> 00:08:26.152
Open up, Washu!

00:08:26.152 --> 00:08:28.822
In that case, it's time to use force!

00:08:28.822 --> 00:08:30.757
Azaka! Mallet!

00:08:30.757 --> 00:08:32.190
Yes, Ma'am!

00:08:42.869 --> 00:08:44.137
Hammer!

00:08:44.137 --> 00:08:45.604
Yes, Ma'am!

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.852
Saw!

00:08:58.852 --> 00:09:00.386
Yes, Ma'am!

00:09:00.386 --> 00:09:01.387
Power drill!

00:09:01.387 --> 00:09:03.116
Yes, Ma'am!

00:09:08.428 --> 00:09:12.165
Very well, then. Azaka.
Kamidake. We'll use... it.

00:09:12.165 --> 00:09:13.967
L-It?

00:09:13.967 --> 00:09:15.768
But if we use it here, it would...

00:09:15.768 --> 00:09:16.703
I'm going to use it!

00:09:16.703 --> 00:09:18.466
- Y-Yes, Ma'am!
- Y-Yes, Ma'am!

00:09:20.974 --> 00:09:24.535
Jurai Cannon of Certain
Destruction and Complete Annihilation!

00:09:42.695 --> 00:09:44.959
How can this be?

00:09:58.144 --> 00:10:01.414
I'm powerless.

00:10:01.414 --> 00:10:04.212
But that won't get me down!

00:10:05.652 --> 00:10:08.382
If I don't do something, who will?!

00:10:13.059 --> 00:10:15.084
That's right!

00:10:19.165 --> 00:10:24.102
Ryo-Ohki... Come with me for a minute.

00:10:46.626 --> 00:10:50.730
A Galaxy Police battleship is
no match for the great Ryoko!

00:10:50.730 --> 00:10:52.322
Here they come!

00:10:53.433 --> 00:10:54.900
Drop dead!

00:11:20.793 --> 00:11:23.796
That'll teach 'em!

00:11:23.796 --> 00:11:27.857
Ryoko. That's the real you.

00:11:28.801 --> 00:11:30.737
It's beautiful.

00:11:30.737 --> 00:11:32.071
Cut it out!

00:11:32.071 --> 00:11:33.906
You're embarrassing me!

00:11:33.906 --> 00:11:35.408
Ryoko...

00:11:35.408 --> 00:11:38.945
Alert! Alert! Ten o'clock,
elevation <i>30</i> degrees,

00:11:38.945 --> 00:11:40.947
multiple warp signatures detected!

00:11:40.947 --> 00:11:43.583
Multiple warp signatures detected!

00:11:43.583 --> 00:11:45.818
Let's go! Point us at them!

00:11:45.818 --> 00:11:47.342
Yes, Sir!

00:11:50.289 --> 00:11:51.958
These guys never learn...

00:11:51.958 --> 00:11:54.688
The great Ryoko can't be
caught by the likes of you!

00:12:03.636 --> 00:12:06.672
Ryo-Ohki? Ryo-Ohki?

00:12:06.672 --> 00:12:08.508
I wonder where Ryo-Ohki went?

00:12:08.508 --> 00:12:11.841
I wanted us to go shopping together...

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:22.344
Hurry, Ryo-Ohki! Go to Mihoshi and Kiyone!

00:12:23.623 --> 00:12:26.793
This is important to the Tenchi Family!

00:12:26.793 --> 00:12:30.024
If we don't hurry,
something horrible will happen!

00:12:36.702 --> 00:12:41.074
That's Mihoshi and Kiyone's patrol ship!

00:12:41.074 --> 00:12:43.476
I knew it! No matter how great the distance,

00:12:43.476 --> 00:12:47.013
our hearts will always reach one another!

00:12:47.013 --> 00:12:48.414
- Yes, Ma'am!
- Yes, Ma'am!

00:12:48.414 --> 00:12:50.850
You in the spaceship! You're speeding!

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.718
Pull over to the side of the road!

00:12:52.718 --> 00:12:54.379
- Oops.
- Oops.

00:12:57.023 --> 00:12:59.425
Wh-What's that?

00:12:59.425 --> 00:13:01.961
A speeding ticket.

00:13:01.961 --> 00:13:06.466
You may be a royal Juraian, but you
still must obey the rules of the road.

00:13:06.466 --> 00:13:09.035
You were going 50 space
kilometers over the limit.

00:13:09.035 --> 00:13:10.935
Sign here, please.

00:13:14.607 --> 00:13:15.908
Here.

00:13:15.908 --> 00:13:19.512
Please pay the fine at your
designated Galaxy Federal Bank...

00:13:19.512 --> 00:13:22.048
...or federal post office.

00:13:22.048 --> 00:13:24.450
U-Um...

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.519
Be careful from now on, all right?

00:13:26.519 --> 00:13:27.820
Kiyone!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.812
W-Wait, Kiyone!

00:13:32.592 --> 00:13:35.361
Please, Kiyone! Mihoshi!

00:13:35.361 --> 00:13:38.164
Come back to Earth! To Okayama!

00:13:38.164 --> 00:13:41.367
That'd be great!

00:13:41.367 --> 00:13:46.139
To tell you the truth, it's boring,
not being able to watch "Policeman"!

00:13:46.139 --> 00:13:47.874
"Policeman"?

00:13:47.874 --> 00:13:49.842
But Kiyone... She's...

00:13:49.842 --> 00:13:54.680
We moved because we received official
orders from Galaxy Police headquarters.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:58.284
We can't change where
we work for personal reasons.

00:13:58.284 --> 00:14:05.024
Then... Then I'll contact Jurai and
have the Galaxy Police issue new orders!

00:14:05.024 --> 00:14:07.860
That'd make it okay, right, Kiyone?

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:11.864
You must be joking!
Don't even think about it, Ayeka!

00:14:11.864 --> 00:14:13.132
Kiyone...

00:14:13.132 --> 00:14:15.334
Kiyone, you're scaring me!

00:14:15.334 --> 00:14:18.938
I finally got out of that
backwater resident officer duty!

00:14:18.938 --> 00:14:22.041
And you want me to go back
to those dark days? No thank you.

00:14:22.041 --> 00:14:24.644
Please don't talk like that!

00:14:24.644 --> 00:14:29.849
Ryoko has gone missing,
and Washu is holed up in her lab.

00:14:29.849 --> 00:14:31.817
And now even you two have...

00:14:31.817 --> 00:14:35.521
I have a feeling that
something strange is going on.

00:14:35.521 --> 00:14:39.292
Oh, we know where Ryoko is!

00:14:39.292 --> 00:14:40.359
What?

00:14:40.359 --> 00:14:41.727
See?

00:14:41.727 --> 00:14:42.995
This is...

00:14:42.995 --> 00:14:47.133
In the past week, she's robbed
the Galactic Federal Bank 14 times,

00:14:47.133 --> 00:14:54.273
destroyed property 157 times, and
destroyed 368 Galaxy Police vessels.

00:14:54.273 --> 00:15:00.613
Ultra-class A criminal Ryoko is
destroying anything that gets in her way.

00:15:00.613 --> 00:15:01.948
Y-You're joking!

00:15:01.948 --> 00:15:05.918
Well, being a space pirate
is Ryoko's job, after all.

00:15:05.918 --> 00:15:08.221
She's gone back to her
old self, in other words.

00:15:08.221 --> 00:15:11.657
The Ryoko we knew on Earth was a fluke.

00:15:11.657 --> 00:15:15.695
If Ryoko shows up on Earth,
please tell me at once.

00:15:15.695 --> 00:15:17.296
What will you do?

00:15:17.296 --> 00:15:21.634
What else? I'll arrest her personally!

00:15:21.634 --> 00:15:26.867
And then I'll return to Galaxy
Police headquarters in triumph!

00:15:27.974 --> 00:15:32.545
What? But you've lived
together as friends all this time!

00:15:32.545 --> 00:15:35.081
Ryoko is no friend of mine!

00:15:35.081 --> 00:15:38.651
But you ate together, took baths together,

00:15:38.651 --> 00:15:40.820
and played video games together!

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:43.022
Stop it, stop it, stop it!

00:15:43.022 --> 00:15:45.691
If talk of me and Ryoko being friends,

00:15:45.691 --> 00:15:48.894
or even rumors of us being
friends got back to headquarters,

00:15:48.894 --> 00:15:52.298
my career prospects will go up in smoke!

00:15:52.298 --> 00:15:54.198
Kiyone...

00:15:56.402 --> 00:15:58.871
I want to forget about
what happened on Earth.

00:15:58.871 --> 00:16:01.874
I wasn't myself when I was on Earth, either.

00:16:01.874 --> 00:16:03.276
Kiyone...

00:16:03.276 --> 00:16:07.813
I'm sorry. It's like Kiyone's changed lately.

00:16:07.813 --> 00:16:10.283
Mihoshi! Let's go!

00:16:10.283 --> 00:16:11.017
Th-That hurts!

00:16:11.017 --> 00:16:13.786
- Come on, don't dawdle!
- Let go, Kiyone!

00:16:13.786 --> 00:16:15.583
Come on!

00:16:20.159 --> 00:16:22.028
- Princess...
- Princess...

00:16:22.028 --> 00:16:25.598
Azaka, Kamidake... Let's go back.

00:16:25.598 --> 00:16:27.088
- Aye.
- Aye.

00:16:47.853 --> 00:16:50.378
Ayeka! The bath's free!

00:16:51.157 --> 00:16:54.854
I have an early day tomorrow,
so I'm gonna go to bed!

00:16:59.932 --> 00:17:02.833
I wonder if Ayeka's gonna be okay?

00:17:10.409 --> 00:17:11.899
Huh?

00:17:31.597 --> 00:17:33.065
Hello, Masaki residence.

00:17:33.065 --> 00:17:34.033
Lord Tenchi?

00:17:34.033 --> 00:17:35.034
Ayeka!

00:17:35.034 --> 00:17:36.969
Lord Tenchi!

00:17:36.969 --> 00:17:40.172
Lord Tenchi, could you
come home right away?

00:17:40.172 --> 00:17:44.143
Huh? On such short notice?

00:17:44.143 --> 00:17:47.380
I have a strange feeling.

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:49.448
It's as if something
horrible is going to happen.

00:17:49.448 --> 00:17:50.850
Something horrible?

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:54.787
Everyone... Everyone has gone
their separate ways all of a sudden.

00:17:54.787 --> 00:17:58.090
Even Washu is locked up in her lab...

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:01.427
Oh. But isn't she always like that?

00:18:01.427 --> 00:18:06.565
Mihoshi and Kiyone have
been transferred to Station 62.

00:18:06.565 --> 00:18:10.403
Huh? You mean they got
promoted? But that's great news!

00:18:10.403 --> 00:18:13.566
And Ryoko has gone missing.

00:18:16.175 --> 00:18:18.544
But Ryoko's always been like that, right?

00:18:18.544 --> 00:18:21.680
It's okay. She'll turn up soon enough.

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:25.584
But... But, Lord Tenchi,
don't you think it's strange?

00:18:25.584 --> 00:18:30.689
We've always been so close, but
now we've split up all of a sudden!

00:18:30.689 --> 00:18:31.824
Really?

00:18:31.824 --> 00:18:36.195
Really! Everything has happened all at once.

00:18:36.195 --> 00:18:38.264
It's almost as if it were planned.

00:18:38.264 --> 00:18:42.564
Ayeka, you sure are a worrywart.
You're just overreacting.

00:18:43.702 --> 00:18:48.474
I'm sorry, Ayeka. I have finals
to study for, so I have to go.

00:18:48.474 --> 00:18:49.575
Huh?

00:18:49.575 --> 00:18:51.944
Please wait, Lord Tenchi!

00:18:51.944 --> 00:18:54.447
Lord Tenchi! Lord Tenchi!

00:18:54.447 --> 00:18:55.915
Hello?

00:18:55.915 --> 00:18:57.183
Lord Tenchi...

00:18:57.183 --> 00:18:59.452
What's the matter, Ayeka?

00:18:59.452 --> 00:19:02.721
Well... Um...

00:19:02.721 --> 00:19:05.383
Um... I...

00:19:06.625 --> 00:19:09.685
Lord Tenchi, I...

00:19:17.903 --> 00:19:19.427
Ayeka?

00:19:21.407 --> 00:19:27.213
I'm in love with you.

00:19:27.213 --> 00:19:31.517
It's simple to put into words.
I've said it time and again!

00:19:31.517 --> 00:19:37.790
However, I really do love you
from the bottom of my heart.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:45.998
Please... Please, Lord Tenchi,
understand how I feel.

00:19:45.998 --> 00:19:48.501
Lord Tenchi? Lord Tenchi?

00:19:48.501 --> 00:19:50.369
Thanks.

00:19:50.369 --> 00:19:53.639
I care for you, too, Ayeka.

00:19:53.639 --> 00:19:55.808
Lord Tenchi...

00:19:55.808 --> 00:19:57.543
Looks like someone's here.

00:19:57.543 --> 00:19:59.278
Give me a minute.

00:19:59.278 --> 00:20:01.447
Just a minute!

00:20:01.447 --> 00:20:03.210
I'll be right there!

00:20:11.957 --> 00:20:13.822
Lord Tenchi...

00:20:19.532 --> 00:20:20.366
Bye!

00:20:20.366 --> 00:20:23.068
Wait! You wanna come in
for some tea or something?

00:20:23.068 --> 00:20:26.872
No, I just came by to
drop off dinner for you.

00:20:26.872 --> 00:20:28.440
Oh.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:30.276
Thanks.

00:20:30.276 --> 00:20:32.111
Study hard, okay?

00:20:32.111 --> 00:20:33.635
You bet!

00:20:36.081 --> 00:20:38.284
Sorry that took so long, Ayeka!

00:20:38.284 --> 00:20:39.751
Huh?

00:20:41.487 --> 00:20:43.155
I won't give up!

00:20:43.155 --> 00:20:48.661
I'll make things the way used to be!

00:20:48.661 --> 00:20:50.390
Fight!

00:20:51.363 --> 00:20:52.965
The poor fool.

00:20:52.965 --> 00:20:56.602
The harder she tries,
the farther apart they become.

00:20:56.602 --> 00:21:01.062
In the end, people are always alone.

00:21:36.275 --> 00:21:39.878
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.878 --> 00:21:43.782
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.782 --> 00:21:47.386
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.386 --> 00:21:51.323
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.323 --> 00:21:54.827
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.827 --> 00:21:58.797
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.797 --> 00:22:02.134
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.134 --> 00:22:06.138
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.138 --> 00:22:08.273
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.273 --> 00:22:10.209
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.209 --> 00:22:11.710
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:17.549
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.549 --> 00:22:21.654
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.654 --> 00:22:24.923
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.923 --> 00:22:28.460
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:33.159
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:42.708 --> 00:22:44.009
Kiyone here!

00:22:44.009 --> 00:22:47.312
We lived together on
Earth until just recently.

00:22:47.312 --> 00:22:51.817
I never thought the day would come when
I'd try arrest Ryoko in this vast universe.

00:22:51.817 --> 00:22:54.586
But if I can complete this assignment,

00:22:54.586 --> 00:22:57.823
we'll be called back to HQ
and be promoted for sure!

00:22:57.823 --> 00:22:59.391
Let's go, Mihoshi!

00:22:59.391 --> 00:23:03.762
I'm going to arrest Ryoko
the space pirate personally!

00:23:03.762 --> 00:23:10.531
Next time on
<i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i> "Old Friends."
